            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AUNT MAMIE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Definitely try this one--it is not a typical jello salad. I folded real whipped cream into it, rather than topping with Cool Whip. I took it to Christmas dinner at Grandma's, and not a spoonful was left. YUMMY.",
            "datePublished": "2002-01-01T11:14:26.450Z"
