            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "skelleym"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I found this recipe in my late mother's recipe box. I could not recall her ever making it but it sounded pretty tasty to me. I took it to a SS class ladies luncheon. Everyone loved and requested the recipe. I figured I could find it on line and not have to rewrite it before I printed it. Allrecipes saved me the trouble. The salad is really good and sweet enough to pass for dessert. It's yummy!",
            "datePublished": "2012-06-16T19:17:32.200Z"
